["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Controlling Biology - Fabian Theis, Helmholtz Munich world model bitter lesson organoid flow matching Lab Compass\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-06-latentspace-一场著名的虚拟细胞竞赛爆冷-线性模型打平了多数深度模型/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c081d94ef2cea125-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">50:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>一场著名的虚拟细胞竞赛爆冷：线性模型打平了多数深度模型</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一场顶级虚拟细胞竞赛证明，简单线性回归能打平许多深度学习模型——问题不在数据信息不够，而在评测指标和训练目标本身设计有问题。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">虚拟细胞</span><span class=\"tag\">扰动预测</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Brain development in the clinic and the classroom | Karen Parker &amp; Jason Yeatman (with the Future of Everything podcast) RCT Spark\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-06-fromourneurons-教育产品没人做随机对照试验-因为验证了也不赚钱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/372ab8e78a5e10ef-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">32:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">From Our Neurons to Yours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>教育产品没人做随机对照试验，因为验证了也不赚钱</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">学校采购教材靠销售代表讲故事打动老师和学区领导，没有监管要求证明效果，证明一款产品比另一款好并不会带来利润，所以没人愿意出钱去验证。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">教育科技</span><span class=\"tag\">循证医学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"E257 对话少楠：明明 AI 有问必答，我怎么还总是信息焦虑？ OPC OpenClaw Amor fati 郑州帮 Lindy Effect 式年迁宫\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-06-zhixing-答案越来越便宜-真正稀缺的是选一个下注的勇气/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2ded4f15035f3605-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"知\"><span class=\"dur\">1:15:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">知行小酒馆</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>答案越来越便宜，真正稀缺的是选一个下注的勇气</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">少楠认为，AI让答案变得唾手可得，但人真正要面对的不是信息匮乏，而是在无穷可能性里敢不敢选一个、下注、然后把时间交出去。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">信息焦虑</span><span class=\"tag\">AI工具</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Inside Salesforce’s $100 Billion M&amp;A Playbook | John Somorjai AOV ISV red teaming outcome-based pricing\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-06-a16z-salesforce并购负责人-好技术没有分销渠道-照样会被饿死/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">49:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>Salesforce并购负责人：好技术没有分销渠道，照样会被饿死</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">John Somorjai说，软件写起来比以往更快更便宜，但初创公司要靠自己搭起能触达全部客户的销售网络，仍要花很多年、不断稀释股权——这正是并购对Salesforce和被收购方都成立的价值所在。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企业软件</span><span class=\"tag\">并购</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"America Votes Against Data Centers, Implications for Big Tech and Beyond, Were Google Bears Right All Along? smiling curve Neoclouds Google Capital Company group chat era\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-06-sharptech-选民几乎全票否决数据中心-但赢家大概率还是大厂/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7a309a358a363994-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:41:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Sharp Tech</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>选民几乎全票否决数据中心，但赢家大概率还是大厂</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">44个反对数据中心的地方公投中43个通过，连市长议员都被罢免，但资本、信贷和土地优势仍集中在亚马逊、谷歌这类大厂手里，算力越稀缺它们反而越占便宜。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">数据中心</span><span class=\"tag\">AI政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Screens in School: What EdTech and AI Are Doing to How Kids Learn transpersonal emergent property NAEP formative vs summative assessment ISIL literacy test\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-06-raisinggh-人手一台校发电脑后-z世代数字素养反而不如千禧一代/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ed6c6b0156a06fc6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">59:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>人手一台校发电脑后，Z世代数字素养反而不如千禧一代</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">工具在你学会某项技能之前介入，是确保你学不会这项技能的头号方式——这正是美国88%学生人手一台校发电脑后，数字素养代际倒退的根源。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">教育科技</span><span class=\"tag\">数字素养</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Reading the Anthropic S-1, with Zvi Mowshowitz S-1 closing the loop pacing the frontier cohort economics net revenue retention bootloader\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-06-complexsys-anthropic三季度放缓不是需求退潮-是算力不够卖/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/20604db48920535f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>Anthropic三季度放缓不是需求退潮，是算力不够卖</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">招股书显示三季度一半算力支出靠5亿美元的高价现货市场填——长约算力早被排满，不是客户不想买token了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">IPO招股书</span><span class=\"tag\">算力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Ramtin Naimi - The State of Venture - [Invest Like the Best, EP.499] cuck tranche NeoLab BCI benchmark maxing\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-06-ilt-风投最赚钱的打法一旦变成共识-可能就不再赚钱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0bcdceac3abfefaf-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">46:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>风投最赚钱的打法一旦变成共识，可能就不再赚钱</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">当大批VC都挤着当Databricks、Anthropic这类确定性标的的被动股东时，Naimi提醒：历史上几乎没有一种大家都觉得简单的策略，长期还能跑赢市场。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">一级市场</span><span class=\"tag\">基金募资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Macro Implications of the Blue Tsunami S-1 Dunning-Kruger effect filibuster blue tsunami\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-06-oddlots-建数据中心最积极的几个州-一夜之间全都成了民主党州长/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">37:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>建数据中心最积极的几个州，一夜之间全都成了民主党州长</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">从得州到弗吉尼亚，数据中心建设重镇的州长清一色转向民主党，过去默认的税收优惠和零监管环境正被重新谈判。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美国大选</span><span class=\"tag\">数据中心</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Milk Cartons &quot;Scared the Bejesus Out of a Generation&quot; - with Roman Mars Century Safe Bundy clock Taylorism\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-06-cautionary-牛奶盒寻人运动吓坏一代美国人-却没找回一个孩子/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b996da73a08744ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">38:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>牛奶盒寻人运动吓坏一代美国人，却没找回一个孩子</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">牛奶盒上的失踪儿童照片让一代美国人提防陌生人绑架，但节目追溯下来，它从未真正帮着找回一个孩子，却掩盖了贫困与家暴这些更常见的儿童危险。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">儿童安全</span><span class=\"tag\">泰勒制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"185: Anthropic招股书丨与Amont李肇宇聊定价逻辑和潜在风险 NRR ARR FDE operating lease / financial lease Neo Cloud bare metal\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-06-latetalk-anthropic招股书没敢给的数字-决定了ipo估值天花板/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d307b4093cb28d05-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"晚\"><span class=\"dur\">59:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">晚点聊</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>Anthropic招股书没敢给的数字，决定了IPO估值天花板</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">招股书回避了唯一关键数字——10月流水；市值能否站上1.5万亿美元，全看这个数字能否撑住年底1000亿美元年化收入的外推逻辑。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">企业销售</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"186: Anthropic招股书丨“银行也有百亿预算”，与Fusion Fund张璐聊大企业在想什么 Physical AI Net Revenue Retention (NRR) Business Automation / Business Optimization AI for Science\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-06-latetalk-银行ai预算破百亿-却难复制coding的爆发速度/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d307b4093cb28d05-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"晚\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">晚点聊</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>银行AI预算破百亿，却难复制Coding的爆发速度</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">银行、药企把AI预算提到史上最高优先级，但张璐认为企业真正改掉工作流程要经历自动化和优化两个阶段，不可能像写代码一样一年内爆发。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企业AI</span><span class=\"tag\">2B投资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"KYC Becomes KYA: Sentinel Bio&#x27;s Joshua Monrad on DNA Screening, Uplift Studies &amp; Agent Monitoring uplift study KYA (Know Your Agent) tacit knowledge managed access regime reverse genetics protocol\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-05-cogrev-病毒合成能力已不缺ai-缺的是机器人的灵巧双手/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/708f88bf8d7da201-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:45:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>病毒合成能力已不缺AI，缺的是机器人的灵巧双手</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Monrad认为模型智能已接近够用，但把设计变成活病毒仍需精细湿实验操作——这靠机器人的灵巧双手，现在的机器人还不够灵巧。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">生物安全</span><span class=\"tag\">AI风险治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Destroying Tumors With Sound: Histotripsy with Dr. Zhen Xu histotripsy cavitation HIFU (High-Intensity Focused Ultrasound) diffraction limit Golden Goose Award\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-05-fromfirstprinc-超声波震碎肝肿瘤-意外让大鼠体内其它肿瘤自行消失/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfee2881de7968b9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">From First Principles</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>超声波震碎肝肿瘤，意外让大鼠体内其它肿瘤自行消失</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大鼠肝肿瘤实验里，被超声波部分击碎的肿瘤组里9/11只不仅未扩散，连未处理的残留病灶也消失——机制是释放抗原激活了全身免疫反应。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">医疗技术</span><span class=\"tag\">肿瘤免疫</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"An AI disaster hits. The president calls Xi. Then what? | Jeremie Harris (crosspost from NonZero) scaling laws superalignment AI Chernobyl track 1.5 / track 2 dialogue MAIM (Mutual Assured AI Malfunction) subthreshold warfare\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-05-eightythousand-中美ai协议靠的不是互信-而是总统感到自己可能被炸死的那一刻/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9ef61ed5d89280cd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">2:22:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>中美AI协议靠的不是互信，而是总统感到自己可能被炸死的那一刻</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他预判会出现一次足够严重的AI事故，让总统本人感到性命堪忧——那一刻美国才会单边暂停训练，并靠切断电缆、网络攻击之类的威胁逼中国同步收手。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中美AI博弈</span><span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"你相信光吗：把几万个GPU用光连起来，到底有多难？| 一期视频看懂共封装光学（CPO） CPO OIO UCIE microring modulator MZI WDM\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-05-laoshi-光刻机已经到了人类工程极限-却仍锁不住微环芯片的波长/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9493e7e74192a076-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"老\"><span class=\"dur\">53:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">老石谈芯</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>光刻机已经到了人类工程极限，却仍锁不住微环芯片的波长</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">硅光学界曾判定微环因波长漂移无法量产，这家公司造了一台激光退火修条设备，把波长良率做到99%，绕开了对顶级光刻机的依赖。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">光互联</span><span class=\"tag\">CPO</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Merve Demirel on the Costs of Migrating for Higher Education in India discrete choice experiment non-pecuniary costs willingness to pay migration penalty\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-05-ideasofindia-真人学长电话劝学-也劝不动印度学生去孟买上大学/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f234d180c819c9b1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">52:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Ideas of India</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>真人学长电话劝学，也劝不动印度学生去孟买上大学</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">给同龄老乡打电话介绍大城市的大学生活后，学生申请本地地级市的比例涨了，但申请孟买、浦那的比例纹丝不动——挡住他们的不是信息，是搬家本身的真实代价。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">高等教育</span><span class=\"tag\">迁移决策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The New CFO: How AI Is Rewriting the Finance Function | Figma CFO Praveer Melwani vibe coding ETL\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-05-a16z-figma-cfo-业务复杂度不变-团队一年后就该变少/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">50:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>Figma CFO：业务复杂度不变，团队一年后就该变少</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">对账、并购尽调原型、投资备忘录生成已被AI压缩到分钟级，Figma CFO Praveer Melwani认为，一旦业务复杂度不再增长，财务团队的人力需求本身会随之收缩。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI财务</span><span class=\"tag\">CFO</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Tokenization, Agentic Trading, Harmonic: Robinhood&#x27;s Mission to Expand Ownership with CEO Vlad Tenev MCP KPI contracts license to operate accredited investor\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-05-nopriors-加密货币靠散户持有赢了政治战-ai却把散户完全排除在外/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bd877a74a55b6594-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">54:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>加密货币靠散户持有赢了政治战，AI却把散户完全排除在外</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">散户从一开始就持有加密货币，因此在监管收紧时能组织起来反击；但私募市场把普通人挡在AI独角兽的融资轮外，只能承受数据中心的噪音和失业风险，却分不到一分钱涨幅。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">代币化</span><span class=\"tag\">智能体交易</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Breaking Down Our Investment Portfolios | #434 benign neglect idiosyncratic risk covered call fund income satiation Fama-French five-factor model\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-05-rationalreminder-这位信奉指数投资的基金经理-却把大笔身家押在自己公司股票上/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0e52c937f0d183da-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:29:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>这位信奉指数投资的基金经理，却把大笔身家押在自己公司股票上</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Ben明知「别重仓雇主股票」是常识，仍把被收购的PWL股权转入OneDigital——他说这是自己主动选的特质风险，因为他是公司参与者，不是领薪水的旁观者。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">资产配置</span><span class=\"tag\">私募股权</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Music Can Be Medicine, with Dr. Dan Levitin default mode network endogenous opioids basal ganglia aphantasia\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-05-sciencevs-音乐止痛是真实的神经机制-但你得先喜欢这首歌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a3282246c3202bd6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">33:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Vs</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>音乐止痛是真实的神经机制，但你得先喜欢这首歌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">科学家用冰桶测试证实，喜欢的音乐会让大脑释放堪比吗啡的内源性阿片类物质来提升痛觉阈值，而讨厌的音乐只会释放皮质醇让人更紧张。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">音乐治疗</span><span class=\"tag\">神经科学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"James Bosworth on What Comes After Lula&#x27;s Stunning Win status of forces agreement chavistas\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-05-oddlots-巴西大选次轮变成对首轮领先者的公投-押注87-的预测市场全错/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">32:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>巴西大选次轮变成对首轮领先者的公投，押注87%的预测市场全错</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">因为选民厌恶现任者，首轮投票选出的「赢家」反而把全部火力引向自己，让原本落后的卢拉在次轮完成反超。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">拉美政治</span><span class=\"tag\">巴西大选</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Health Insurance in America Blue Cross Red Scare Campaigns, Inc. wage and price controls\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-05-throughline-锁定美国雇主医保的不是二战意外-而是艾森豪威尔的选择/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1989x1989+0+0/resize/3000/quality/66/format/jpg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F02%2F15%2Fa2ebac794881a9c592b8881be551%2F4c34746d-230d-4248-8438-6f7a55f11d5f.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">52:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>锁定美国雇主医保的不是二战意外，而是艾森豪威尔的选择</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">二战工资管制只是让雇主医保偶然发芽，真正让它变成美国永久制度的，是1950年代艾森豪威尔政府主动把这项税收优惠永久写进法律。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">医保史</span><span class=\"tag\">雇主医保</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Britain&#x27;s First Homo Sapiens LRJ (Lincombeian-Ranisian-Jerzmanowician) leaf points marine isotope stage 3 (MIS3) prism system Aurignacian\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-05-ancients-英国最早智人化石的年代-可能被保存用的胶水测错了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb5d9c468a9839ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">53:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>英国最早智人化石的年代，可能被保存用的胶水测错了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这块1927年出土的下颌骨被测定为三万五千年前，但修复用的胶水会让放射性碳测年失真，研究者认为实际年代应该更早。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">旧石器时代</span><span class=\"tag\">尼安德特人</span>\n</div></div></a>"]